cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AB Quantum Processor Program 0.1.0 — V20, the AB-cloud compiler
message: >-
  If you use this package, please cite both this program and the
  mother AB Research Program.
authors:
  - fullname: AB Quantum Processor Program
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
license: PROPRIETARY
abstract: >-
  Phase P0 of the "AB processor" program: an ISA with a phase
  continuum, an exact compiler for arbitrary unitary logic
  (4x4/8x8, machine floor), memory, ALU, blind reading of the
  Riemann zeros off direct algebraic functions (no zero table),
  and holonomic nonlocality with exact no-signaling. Companion to
  the AB Research Program (V1-V19).
keywords:
  - Aharonov-Bohm
  - quantum processor
  - compiler
  - Riemann zeta
  - nonlocality
  - Hilbert-Polya
